@startuml
' Source Use Case: UC-017 — Remove Wear Event
' Primary Specification: ../use-cases/UC-017-remove-wear-event.md
' Supporting Authorities: ../SRS.md (v0.3); ../business-rules.md (v0.1.2)
' Business/Product: ../../01-business/BRD.md (v0.3); ../../02-product/PRD.md (v0.2)
' Master Actors/Scope: ../use-cases/use-case-diagram.puml
' Process Authority: ../../../Initial files/CapsuleAI_Scrum_Development_Workflow.md, Sections 11, 39–42, 46
' Version: 0.1; Status: Baseline Draft
' SRS trace: FR-WEAR-007, FR-WEAR-008, FR-WEAR-010, FR-WEAR-012, FR-PERS-013, DATA-RET-001, ERR-NET-001
' Rule trace: BRULE-AUTH-001, BRULE-WEAR-005, BRULE-WEAR-006, BRULE-PERS-005, BRULE-PERS-006, BRULE-HIST-003
' Flow coverage: UC Sections 6–10; alternatives and failures retain their textual meaning.
' The textual Use Case Specification remains the normative behavioral source.

title AD-017 - Remove Wear Event
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false

|User|
start
:Identify one Wear Event and request removal;
|CapsuleAI|
if (Authorized event access usable?) then (Yes)
    :Identify intended report;
else (No)
    :Pause protected use; require renewed access (UC-002);
    stop
endif
repeat
    if (Intended event still effective and unchanged?) then (Yes)
        :Explain individual removal;
        :Keep underlying outfit/garments and other reports distinct;
        |User|
        if (Proceed with this individual removal?) then (Yes)
            :Express removal intention for selected event;
        else (Cancel)
            |CapsuleAI|
            :Keep accepted event and effects unchanged;
            stop
        endif
        |CapsuleAI|
        :Attempt acceptance of selected-event removal;
        if (Removal accepted?) then (Yes)
            :Immediately exclude selected event
from effective history, utilization, recency and personalization;
            :Recompute history/utilization for surviving reports;
            if (Same-outfit/original-day reports survive?) then (Yes)
                :Retain each surviving historical report;
                :Recompute latest surviving absolute anchor;
                :Recompute age/decay of single group increment;
            else (None)
                :Remove this group's Wear-based contribution;
            endif
            :Recompute recency from remaining effective events;
            :Confirm removal and explain physical deletion deadline;
            note right
              Applicable personal event data is physically
              deleted within 30 days of accepted removal.
              Underlying Outfit/Garments, unrelated reports
              and independent feedback remain intact.
            end note
            |User|
            :Review available history/utilization;
            stop
        else (Failed / unconfirmed)
            |CapsuleAI|
            :Distinguish known failure from uncertain outcome;
            :Retain event/effects on known failure;
            |User|
            :Review selected event/history before safe retry;
        endif
    else (Already removed / changed)
        |CapsuleAI|
        :Show actual available history/state;
        |User|
        :Verify intended target; do not remove another report;
    endif
    |User|
repeat while (Retry verified individual removal?) is (Yes) not (No)
|CapsuleAI|
:End without claiming unconfirmed removal;
stop

@enduml
